WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:08.500
Gintama Production Committee

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.150
Instead of being captured by the enemy...

00:00:55.220 --> 00:01:00.660
Let's end this like true samurai and commit suicide.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.800
Don't be stupid.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:07.540
Get up.

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:15.040
If you have time to fantasize about a beautiful death,

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.760
then why don't you just live your life to the fullest until the end?

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.150
Let's go, Zura.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.520
It's not Zura.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.270
It's Katsura.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.080
The silver-haired warrior soaked in blood...

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:46.600
...going into the battlefield, was truly...

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.380
a <i>demon</i>.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.050
Gintama

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.050
The Movie

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:58.300
Birth of the White Demon

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.300
Preview

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:11.550
This famous planet is such a waste on these primitive monkeys!

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.890
The lead sky

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:10.480
falls heavily upon us

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.560
as the blindingly white sun

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:14.220
Charge!

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:17.150
crumbles away.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.800
Kiheitai, follow my lead!

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:22.440
My ears are ringing louder and louder.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.080
Lightly and swiftly,

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.510
Why are you fighting alone? Did you get hit on the head?

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.470
the swallows flying low

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:30.680
draw figures of eight

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.480
Look who's talking.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.210
as they rise over the valley of skyscrapers.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:32.750
You've got a point there!

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.170
Here.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:42.220
A downpour is coming.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.510
I'll lend you a hand, Gintoki.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.770
Shut up!

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.220
Who the hell would want help from you?!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.230
I've made up my mind.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.970
I'm gonna go up to the sky.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:59.340
This war is only going to result in the death of our friends.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.490
I can't take it anymore.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.080
I'm sick and tired of watching my friends die.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.010
Under the cloudy sky,

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.300
she walks empty-handed

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.110
fearing for the rain

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.860
I remember...

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:22.370
We've... met before.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:22.640
that may leave her drenched.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.140
So I'll follow suit.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.460
I'll proudly show my cowardice

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:35.950
and look up at the sky.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.000
Gintoki!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.130
This bastard...

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:33.080
is mine!

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.970
Get out of my way!

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.070
Shut up!

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:01.680
Sho...

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:08.510
Shouyou-sensei!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.770
This was the moment it all began

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.230
Coming Next Spring

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:21.240
Also Showing

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:21.240
Shinsengumi

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:21.240
-Journey to Edo-

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
PRE-ORDER SPECIAL

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
Everyone who pre-ordered
tickets will receive

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
Elizabeth

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
glasses

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
AT THE THEATER!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.280
PRE-ORDER SPECIAL

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.280
Everyone who pre-ordered
tickets will receive

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.280
Elizabeth

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.280
glasses

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:26.280
AT THE THEATER!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.160
This is great, isn't it?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.120
Gintama is finally getting a movie!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.380
That's right!

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.130
It's been two years since we got kicked off of prime time.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.420
Our efforts are finally paying off.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.340
Now we'll become popular like the other JUMP anime series.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.730
We're finally getting a movie!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:47.760
I want a cool subtitle like what **** has.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.640
Yeah, that would be cool.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.350
Something like Daffunda~Sylvester Stallone.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.990
[Note: "Daffunda" is a famous line by Japanese comedian Ken Shimura]

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.690
An English subtitle would look pretty cool.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.160
Gin-san, you've got it all wrong.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.040
It's ********.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.840
And "daffunda" isn't English.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:03.150
Besides, ***** would never work with "daffunda"!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.900
But this is really great.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.910
[Note: JUMP Festa Anime Tour is where both OVAs were first shown]

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.600
We get to tell everyone at Anime Tour

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.710
that we have a movie coming.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.380
Oh...

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:15.120
I completely forgot to mention an important detail about the movie.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:15.830
Huh?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:16.830
What is it?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.770
Well, honestly, this preview...

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.730
<i>is all a lie...</i>

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.610
Like we'll ever get a movie.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.120
Yeah. I thought so.

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:32.970
Wait!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.530
Are you serious?!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:34.060
It's a lie?!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.170
That whole preview was a lie?!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.240
Of course it was.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.380
It'll never happen.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.730
But it looked like a lot of work went into that.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:44.240
We might as well finish it since we went this far.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.980
We were just being try-hards.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:48.050
We got carried away and bit off more than we could chew.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:49.910
Happens a lot to 8th graders in the summer.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.620
That's right.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.050
Remember when Nakajima dyed his hair,

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:54.620
and then got called to the office right when school started?

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.560
Like hell I do!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.890
Who's Nakajima anyway?!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.030
Gin-chan, since we put so much work into this fake preview,

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:01.840
we've lost most of our budget.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.800
I see.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.650
The widescreen format isn't exactly cheap,

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.590
so let’s just return to our usual TV size.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:09.330
Like this.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.590
W-Wait!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.480
What are you doing?!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.950
I'm half out of frame now!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.540
What's with this half-assed fix?!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.100
Nothing can be done. It's only you Shinpachi.

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.910
What the heck do you mean by that?!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.350
And why am I still out of the frame in the new angle?!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.690
Anyways, this still feels different than usual.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.040
Something feels off, right?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.170
Yeah, I agree.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:25.610
In that case...

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:46.880
Yorozuya Gin-chan

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.370
Wait!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:31.110
Ahh, l feel much more comfortable with our normal background.

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:32.990
There's no place like home, right?

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.810
Shut it!

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.910
You sound like a mother who just returned from vacation!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.110
Now we're just as lazy as with our TV broadcasts!

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:42.000
Gin-chan, something is still off.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:42.900
You think so?

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.810
Well, that's probably because our TV is only 14 inches.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.690
So it's a little big on the screen.

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:48.620
How about this?

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:49.340
Hey!

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.420
Stop that already!

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:54.350
We're at Anime Tour, and all you do is mess around with the picture?!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.350
You think our loyal fans will be satisfied with this?!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:00.390
[Note: "Dragon Ball: Yo! The Return of Son Goku and Friends!!" was shown at the same Anime Tour as this in 2008]

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.250
Don't worry,

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.530
I'd be fine just watching Dragon Ball.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.930
[Note: "One Piece: Romance Dawn" was also shown at this Anime Tour]

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.930
I want to watch One Piece already!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.920
Shut up! Just do your best on Gintama!

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:07.900
Boss, how much longer do you plan on chatting?

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:08.850
Okita-san!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:13.910
We'll never get our turn to speak if you keep blabbering.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.350
That's right.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.650
Well, not like Hijikata-san's turn matters.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:18.310
What was that?!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.240
Calm down, Toushi.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.850
We're on the big screen of Anime Tour.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.460
So act like a man and stop embarrassing yourself!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.960
What the hell are you doing on the big screen?!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.400
Hey! Why are you naked?!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.650
Ah, well, this is such a big moment, you know.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:35.220
I couldn't decide on what to wear and ended up with just this...

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.220
Kondo-san!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:37.970
Sis!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.230
Oh my, Shin-chan.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:43.410
We're finally at Anime Tour, and yet I, the heroine, still haven't made my appearance.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.770
How could this be?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.480
If Tae-chan's the heroine, then I'm the only suitable hero.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.060
Big Sis! The heroine <i>is...</i>

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.820
How heartless of you!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.700
I'm your one and only heroine!

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:58.450
Don't tell me you thought I'd be satisfied with this fake trailer!

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.480
I am the protagonist today!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.310
Katsura!!

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.760
You bastard!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.270
You've got some nerve to show up here!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.250
Oh man... Sorry, guys.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:10.740
I tried to get here in time for Anime Tour, but...

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:14.390
Why?

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.530
I want to be the heroine.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.650
Don't worry.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.460
Even if we're both heroines, different people have different tastes.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:22.000
Mine is...Tae-chan...

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.660
This is a special episode that'll never air on <i>TV...</i>

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:25.500
Back off, sow!

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:28.520
Get back here!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.530
Hey!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.180
What's going on?

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:31.730
Whose fault is this?!

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.370
Like I'd know, you idiot!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.650
Oh man...

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.370
It got out of control again.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:41.750
Don't
Smoke!

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.880
You made it to this Anime Tour, and yet what are you doing?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:41.750
Now we have no time left.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.340
Anyways, I want to watch One Piece already!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.490
E-Elizabeth...

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:51.460
No, the old man from editorial supervision...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.500
Hey...

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.960
Frizzy hair protagonist!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.650
Wrap it up.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.300
Hey!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:56.890
That's not fair.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:57.550
See ya.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.970
Don't run away!

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:02.330
Wh-What should we do, Gin-san?

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.480
There's nothing we can do.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:10.780
[Note: The music is <i>"We Are!"</i> from One Piece's first opening]

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.380
All hands on board!

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.030
We'll end it like we always do.

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:14.000
Well, here we go then!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.960
Three!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.220
Two!

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.440
One!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.160
Piece!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:10:38.000
2345

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:25.750
Let's get all our dreams together

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:31.500
and set out to find everything we want!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:38.260
[Note: Parody of the Dragonball Z anime opening theme]

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:39.300
What the heck? What the heck?

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:44.430
What the heck?

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:51.520
In this town covered by night, we'll keep fighting until the end.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:56.990
What's the limit? Every week is the time limit!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.570
What the heck?! By the riverside in the former capital?

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.580
I look up at the sky while riding in a chariot.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:06.160
What the heck? In the kansai dialect!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.870
We've never heard of that!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:14.260
What the heck? What the heck?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:19.430
Come on! This is Konishi Man!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
PRE-ORDER SPECIAL

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
Everyone who pre-ordered
tickets will receive

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
Elizabeth

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
glasses

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
AT THE THEATER!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
The

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:27.100
End
